{
  "_comment": "কে কী কাজ করবে — এই ফাইলটাই টিমের তালিকা। নতুন এজেন্ট যোগ করতে নিচে একটা ব্লক কপি করে বসান।",
  "settings": {
    "default_agent": "opencode",
    "max_rounds": 3,
    "max_calls_per_run": 8,
    "max_pair_calls": 3,
    "reply_char_limit": 4000,
    "key_cooldown_sec": 3600
  },
  "agents": [
    {
      "name": "opencode",
      "label": "🧑‍💻 OpenCode",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "opencode",
        "run",
        "--auto",
        "--model",
        "$OPENCODE_MODEL:-opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-free",
        "{message}"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "chat_timeout_sec": 150,
      "keywords": [
        "code",
        "fix",
        "bug",
        "refactor",
        "test",
        "implement",
        "কোড",
        "বাগ",
        "ঠিক"
      ],
      "notes": "প্রথমে OpenCode এর ফ্রি মডেল; 'usage limit' এলে OpenRouter দিয়ে আবার (fallback, এখনো যাচাই হয়নি)",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "opencode",
          "run",
          "--auto",
          "--model",
          "$OPENCODE_FALLBACK_MODEL:-$FREE_M1",
          "{message}"
        ]
      ],
      "priority": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "cline",
      "label": "🟦 Cline",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": false,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "cline",
        "-P",
        "cline",
        "-k",
        "$CLINE_API_KEY",
        "-y",
        "{message}"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "keywords": [
        "ui",
        "frontend",
        "design",
        "review",
        "plan",
        "রিভিউ",
        "ডিজাইন"
      ],
      "notes": "⚠️ বন্ধ: OpenRouter ফ্রি টিয়ারে Cline ২,৮৩,১১৫ টোকেন চায়, afford করে ৩৩,৩২৩ — 'requires more credits'। আপাতত OpenCode (fallback সহ) ও Claude Code যথেষ্ট",
      "env": {
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY": "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "keys": [
        "CLINE_API_KEY"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "claude",
      "label": "🟠 Claude Code",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat"
      ],
      "command": [
        "claude",
        "-p",
        "{message}",
        "--output-format",
        "text"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 900,
      "chat_timeout_sec": 150,
      "env": {
        "ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL": "https://openrouter.ai/api",
        "ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN": "$OPENROUTER_API_KEY",
        "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY": "",
        "ANTHROPIC_MODEL": "$CLAUDE_MODEL:-openrouter/free"
      },
      "keys": [
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "architecture",
        "hard",
        "refactor",
        "গুরুত্বপূর্ণ",
        "আর্কিটেকচার"
      ],
      "notes": "`-p` + `--output-format text`। ANTHROPIC_MODEL = $CLAUDE_MODEL:-openrouter/free; খালি উত্তর/লিমিট হলে FREE_M2, FREE_M3, শেষে openrouter/free",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "$FREE_M2:-openrouter/free"
        ],
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "$FREE_M3:-openrouter/free"
        ],
        [
          "claude",
          "-p",
          "{message}",
          "--output-format",
          "text",
          "--model",
          "openrouter/free"
        ]
      ],
      "priority": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "hermes",
      "label": "☤ Hermes",
      "kind": "cli",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat",
        "memory"
      ],
      "command": [
        "hermes",
        "chat",
        "-q",
        "{message}",
        "-m",
        "openrouter/free",
        "--provider",
        "openrouter",
        "-Q",
        "--yolo",
        "--max-turns",
        "6"
      ],
      "timeout_sec": 600,
      "chat_timeout_sec": 120,
      "keys": [
        "OPENROUTER_API_KEY"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "remember",
        "memory",
        "notes",
        "launch",
        "মনে",
        "পরিকল্পনা"
      ],
      "notes": "শুধু OpenRouter + শুধু ফ্রি মডেল (FREE_M1/M2)। পেইড মডেল দিলে 402 'never purchased credits' আসে। --max-turns 6: ৩-এ কম পড়ে উত্তর ছাড়াই শেষ হয়ে যেত।",
      "fallback_commands": [
        [
          "hermes",
          "chat",
          "-q",
          "{message}",
          "-m",
          "$FREE_M1:-openrouter/free",
          "--provider",
          "openrouter",
          "-Q",
          "--yolo",
          "--max-turns",
          "6"
        ],
        [
          "hermes",
          "chat",
          "-q",
          "{message}",
          "-m",
          "$FREE_M2:-openrouter/free",
          "--provider",
          "openrouter",
          "-Q",
          "--yolo",
          "--max-turns",
          "6"
        ]
      ],
      "priority": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "openhands",
      "label": "🖐️ OpenHands",
      "kind": "openhands_cloud",
      "enabled": true,
      "roles": [
        "worker",
        "chat",
        "cloud"
      ],
      "mention": "@openhands",
      "keywords": [
        "issue",
        "pr",
        "big",
        "long",
        "বড়"
      ],
      "notes": "ওদের ক্লাউড API (priority 1) — গ্রুপ চ্যাটেও উত্তর দেয়। কোটা বাঁচাতে দিনে সর্বোচ্চ ৩ conversation (ওদের ফ্রি টিয়ার ~১০/দিন)।",
      "priority": 1,
      "keys": [
        "OPENHANDS_API_KEY"
      ],
      "daily_limit": 3,
      "timeout_sec": 900
    }
  ]
}
